---
// Quiz figure for go-first-program-modules-packages set 04: two programs, the logic they share, and a second module outside the repo.
// It restates the situation in the stem; it does not say where the shared logic should live.
// Inline SVG, site tokens only, no <marker>/<defs>/ids.
---
<div class="qfig-gq01sl">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 580 250" role="img" aria-label="One repository holding two programs, api and worker, that both use the same shared logic. A second module outside the repository is drawn with a dashed line toward the shared logic.">
    <text x="0" y="20" class="qfig-gq01sl-h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>One repo, two programs, one shared piece of logic</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Một repo, hai chương trình, một phần logic dùng chung</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="10" y="36" width="350" height="200" rx="8" class="qfig-gq01sl-card" />
    <text x="24" y="58" class="qfig-gq01sl-t">
      <tspan data-lang-en>The repo (one module)</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>Repo (một module)</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="30" y="76" width="140" height="48" rx="6" class="qfig-gq01sl-box" />
    <text x="100" y="105" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq01sl-c">api</text>
    <rect x="200" y="76" width="140" height="48" rx="6" class="qfig-gq01sl-box" />
    <text x="270" y="105" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq01sl-c">worker</text>

    <line x1="100" y1="124" x2="150" y2="168" class="qfig-gq01sl-ln" />
    <line x1="270" y1="124" x2="220" y2="168" class="qfig-gq01sl-ln" />

    <rect x="90" y="168" width="190" height="52" rx="6" class="qfig-gq01sl-hl" />
    <text x="185" y="190" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq01sl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>shared logic</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>logic dùng chung</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="185" y="209" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq01sl-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>used by both programs</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>cả hai chương trình dùng</tspan>
    </text>

    <rect x="410" y="132" width="160" height="62" rx="8" class="qfig-gq01sl-card" />
    <text x="490" y="158" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq01sl-b">
      <tspan data-lang-en>another module</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>module khác</tspan>
    </text>
    <text x="490" y="178" text-anchor="middle" class="qfig-gq01sl-m">
      <tspan data-lang-en>outside the repo</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>ngoài repo</tspan>
    </text>
    <line x1="410" y1="194" x2="282" y2="198" class="qfig-gq01sl-dash" />
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-gq01sl { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-gq01sl svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-gq01sl text { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .qfig-gq01sl .qfig-gq01sl-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq01sl .qfig-gq01sl-t { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq01sl .qfig-gq01sl-c { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq01sl .qfig-gq01sl-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-gq01sl .qfig-gq01sl-m { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-gq01sl-card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .qfig-gq01sl-box { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq01sl-hl { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--act-3); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq01sl-ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .qfig-gq01sl-dash { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
</style>
